      <h2>1. Overview of Website Terms</h2>
      <p>
        These Terms and Conditions constitute a legally binding agreement between you and <strong>ELVORA Skincare Pakistan</strong> concerning your access to and use of <strong>elvora-se1xnqm7.myshopify.com</strong>. By accessing our platform, adding products to your cart, or completing an order, you confirm your unconditional acceptance of these terms.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Eligibility & Customer Representations</h2>
      <p>By using this website, you represent and warrant that:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>You are at least 18 years of age or accessing under the supervision of a parent/legal guardian.</li>
        <li>All registration and delivery information submitted (including recipient name, phone number, and physical street address) is true, accurate, and current.</li>
        <li>You will not use the website for any fraudulent, unauthorized, or illegal purposes.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Clinical Skincare Disclaimer & Patch Testing</h2>
      <p>
        ELVORA products are non-prescription cosmetic and cosmeceutical formulations engineered to enhance skin barrier health, texture, and hydration. However:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Products are for <strong>topical external application only</strong>. Avoid contact with inner eyes and mucous membranes.</li>
        <li>Individual skin chemistry varies. Customers are strongly advised to perform a small <strong>24-hour patch test</strong> behind the ear or inner forearm prior to full facial application.</li>
        <li>Our products are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any dermatological medical condition (such as cystic dermatitis, psoriasis, or eczema) without consultation with a certified medical doctor.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Pricing, Accuracy & Order Acceptance</h2>
      <p>
        All prices are listed in <strong>Pakistani Rupees (PKR)</strong> and are inclusive of standard applicable domestic duties. We reserve the right at any time to modify prices or discontinue products without prior notice. In the event of a typographical pricing error or inventory stockout, ELVORA reserves the right to cancel or amend the affected order and notify the customer promptly.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Cash on Delivery (COD) Rules & Refusal Policy</h2>
      <p>
        Cash on Delivery is offered as a trusted convenience across Pakistan. By choosing COD, you enter into a binding purchase contract. If a customer repeatedly refuses delivery upon courier arrival without legitimate grounds (such as confirmed physical damage or wrong product), ELVORA reserves the right to blacklist the customer’s phone number and delivery address from future COD privileges.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Intellectual Property Rights</h2>
      <p>
        The content on this website—including but not limited to text, graphic design, custom liquid code, bottle mockups, brand logos, trade names, and product photography—is the proprietary intellectual property of ELVORA Skincare and is protected by Pakistani copyright, trademark, and unfair competition laws.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Applicable Law & Jurisdiction</h2>
