        These Terms and Conditions and your use of the website are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the <strong>Islamic Republic of Pakistan</strong>. Any disputes arising hereunder shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the competent courts in Lahore, Pakistan.
      </p>

